    q: "A multinational healthcare organization integrates Generative AI into its data science workflow. The system automatically summarizes clinical notes, generates synthetic patient data for model training, assists analysts in writing Python code for predictive analytics quickly, and produces natural-language explanations of diagnostic trends for hospital managers.<br><br>Which of the following best explains the combined strategic benefit of Generative AI in this scenario?",
